      "remedialSection": "守恒电荷、重子数、轻子数。"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "ib_math_i1",
    "chapterId": "ib_math_ch1",
    "title": "向量与几何",
    "type": "lecture",
    "body": "向量点积 a·b=|a||b|cosθ，用于判垂直（=0）求夹角。叉积模=|a||b|sinθ=平行四边形面积。向量方程直线 r=a+tb。",
    "quiz": {
      "question": "Two vectors perpendicular ⟹ dot product =",
      "options": [
        "0",
